<R_SMARTCLASS_FIELD_LABEL CODE=",["FL_FIELD_ID",",[""FIELD_NAME"",""CREATE_FIRST_VERSION_EARLIER"",]",]["FL_LANGUAGE","0",]"  LOCAL_ID="44955" >
<FL_COMMENT ><![CDATA[Tick this flag to activate object persistency. When creating a new object, two similar audit trails will be created: a CREATION one with its date in 1900, a MODIFICATION one with the effective date. Historicized tables records will always start in 1900. This will allow you to insert later versions at an earlier date than the date of creation, without impacting what was integrated in effective date when the object was created.]]></FL_COMMENT>
